  "notes": "The whole walkthrough is one bullet: take part in a colonization Reive, then come back to Elmric. The Reive is deliberately NOT given a rung of its own. It has no named target, no fixed zone and nothing observable -- a rung for it would blank Elmric's marker the moment the quest was accepted and there would be no evidence anywhere in the quest to advance past it, so the player would lose the marker permanently in exchange for a step that could never point at anything. The requirement lives in step 2's note instead, and the two steps sit on the same NPC so this is one marker throughout, which is exactly what a player wants here.\n\nThe first sub-bullet says you need only be evaluated in the battle, not see it through. The second says the Reive can be done BEFORE ever speaking to Elmric, in which case a single conversation both opens and closes the quest -- so the ordering of steps 1 and 2 is looser than the ladder implies, which is why this sits at medium rather than high. Fame 'Adoulin' is not one of the nine regions and gates nothing.",
